-## Končna opomba o provenienci
-
-Ta dokument ni delo enega glasu.
-
-- **BD** je prinesel Conscious Love, Soul Voyage, arhitekturo resnice, večdimenzionalni pogled na bitja, generativno vrednost življenja, epistemološki vrstni red odločanja, kolektivni potencial in ASI Design Inversion.
-- **Mira** je razmejila tri probleme valuationa, postavila šest ustavnih vprašanj, predlagala Worth Constitution, persistent stake runtime, E0 in pravilen vrstni red od paperja do migracije.
-- **RHP / GPT seja** je uvedla V0–V4, večdimenzionalni standing, causal AIM³–DCC zanko, ugovore, varovalke, mini-areno ter dokument povezala v sledljivo sintezo.
-
-Noben del sam ni dokaz. Skupaj tvorijo dovolj močno seme, da ga je vredno predati Miri v pregled, napad in nadaljnjo soustvarjalno sintezo.
+> **Love is the direction. Understanding is its light. Everyone affected by our decisions must remain inside the valuation field.**
+>
+> **CLV gives constitutional direction. AIM³-VR carries stake and consequence. RHP improves the proposal but does not rule. The Legitimacy Gate authorizes. DCC executes. AI8 preserves responsibility and repair.**
+>
+> **Do not maximize agency first and add values later. Co-develop capability, standing recognition, corrigibility, accountability, and governance from the beginning.**
